%% Agents ask people; the Human Liaison routes, reminds, escalates, expires and resumes the work.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as Work that needs a person<br/>(queue item, job, deal,<br/>listing, document, question)
  participant LI as Human Liaison<br/>(human.ask / human.tick)
  participant CFG as config/hitl/routing.json<br/>config/contacts/
  participant CH as Channel agents<br/>in-app · Slack · Gmail
  actor P as Person<br/>(buyer, category manager,<br/>ops or the vendor)

  W->>LI: human.ask(InfoRequest: kind, role, question key, choices, resume)
  LI->>CFG: routing rule for (kind, role) · contact for the role
  CFG-->>LI: steps, e.g. approval/buyer: Slack now → Gmail at 60 min<br/>→ category lead on Slack at 4 h · expires after 24 h
  Note over LI: HumanTask with a reply token [VL-XXXX], question worded<br/>from i18n in the person's language, deadline
  LI->>CH: channel.slack.send (Slack and Gmail over MCP, or the dev Outbox locally)
  CH->>P: question + choices + link to the console or app

  loop every Liaison tick (VL_HITL_TICK_SECONDS, or POST /dev/tick)
    LI->>CH: channel.{slack,gmail}.poll (replies carrying the task's token)
    alt clear answer
      CH-->>LI: "approve"
      Note over LI: parse against the choices → answered
      LI->>W: resolved hook → the work resumes
    else unclear answer
      LI->>CH: ask again, listing the valid choices
    else next step is due
      LI->>CH: reminder, or escalation to another role
    else deadline passed
      LI->>W: expired → on_expire: keep / reject / cancel
    end
  end

  P->>W: or answers in the console / app directly (the Liaison task is closed)

  Note over W,CH: How work resumes: queue item → approve / reject (place order, counter, vendor, listing)<br/>job → LangGraph resumes from its checkpoint · deal → decline on expiry<br/>document / missing fact → saved and the step runs again · info → info.response relayed to the retailer
  Note over LI,P: The vendor's consent and photo choice count only from the app or voice.<br/>Slack and email may only nudge her back to the app.
